# Build context for packages/docs/Dockerfile.
#
# Next to the Dockerfile rather than at the repository root, because the root is
# not this package's to edit -- and because this build takes the repository root
# as its context, since the site's content is the repository's own markdown.
#
# Without this, `COPY . .` would carry the host's installed dependencies and
# build output into the image.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.source
**/dist
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/coverage
**/*.log

.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store
